{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309260","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1130926001:1":{"text":"괜한 사람 잡지 말라고! 난 돈 받고 이 아이를 돌보러 온 사람이야. 내가 왜 아이를 괴롭히겠어!","source_cn":"喂！别冤枉好人！我收了好大一笔钱，接了委托来看护他们，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD329597823FC2983","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"괜한 사람 잡지 말라고! 난 돈 받고 이 아이를 돌보러 온 사람이야. 내가 왜 아이를 괴롭히겠어!","female":"괜한 사람 잡지 말라고! 난 돈 받고 이 아이를 돌보러 온 사람이야. 내가 왜 아이를 괴롭히겠어!","variant_male_record_index":"120213","variant_female_record_index":"120214","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130926002:1":{"text":"계속해서 자기 부모가 어디 갔는지 나한테 따지잖아. 그걸 내가 어떻게 알겠어?","source_cn":"看看他，一个劲地追问他父母去哪里了。我怎么会知道？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ED3E8A77027703B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130926003:1":{"text":"아, 쫌… 그만 좀 울어.","source_cn":"真是的……别哭了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1966DD890260BC78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130926004:1":{"text":"흑흑… 아빠… 엄마…","source_cn":"呜呜……爹……娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39C8DC39CE09207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1130926004":{"text":"흑흑… 아빠… 엄마…","source_cn":"呜呜……爹……娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39C8DC39CE09207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1130926005:1":{"text":"우리에게 의뢰한 트라이브의 말로는 크림슨 고원에 보물을 찾으러 갔다더군.","source_cn":"委托我们的蛮血说，他们的父母去深红高原寻找宝藏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA831087A3F2124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1130926006:1":{"text":"…엄마, 아빠를 찾으러 갈래요!","source_cn":"——我要去找他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4604E429C67B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1130926007:1":{"text":"말도 안 되는 소리 하지 마! 너희를 돌보는 게 내 일이라고! 밖에 나가면 야수들에게 잡혀 먹일 거야!","source_cn":"说什么傻话！我收了钱要看着你们！你出去会被发疯的野兽吃掉的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC162606A08073885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1130926008:1":{"text":"그, 그럼 아빠, 엄마도… 흐흑 흐흐흑…","source_cn":"那、那爹娘他们不就……呜呜呜呜呜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C3EBD66B2EE357C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1130926009:1":{"text":"아이고, 왜 또 우는 거야! 내 말은 그게 아니고…","source_cn":"哎呀，你怎么又哭上了！我不是这个意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800F5788469BE8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title